                  "termSlug": "shell-stitch"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " border worked in one round all the way around after the body is complete. The shells are evenly spaced with single dc stitches between. The result has an attractive scalloped edge on all four sides. DK cotton on a 4 mm hook."
          }
        ]
      },
